{
    "title": "Evite: Email & SMS Invitations",
    "description": "Life\u2019s better together, even when we're apart. Evite helps you connect for your most important life moments, from kids\u2019 birthdays to happy hours. We make coming together, virtually or face-to-face, effortless and even more memorable for you and your loved ones every day.\r\n\r\nThrowing a party? Use the app to:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Choose from thousands of new free and Premium digital invitations for occasions big and small, organized by event category and keyword search\r\n\u2022 Create invitations in minutes: customize event title, time, location, and host message simply by tapping\r\n\u2022 Personalize free design templates with photos from your phone, or fully customize Premium invitations and envelopes\r\n\u2022 Send invitations via text message or email by choosing right from your phone contacts or Evite contacts\r\n\u2022 Track RSVPs in real time (including confirmation of who has viewed your invitation)\r\n\u2022 Send updates and reminders to everyone (or just those who haven\u2019t responded)\r\n\u2022 Invite more people, update your event settings, or control notifications at any time\r\n\u2022 Planning a virtual event? Add links to video chats, directly in any of our 4,000+ invitations\r\n\r\n\r\nInvited to a party? Use the app to:\r\n\r\n\u2022 RSVP (including for your plus-ones!) after receiving your text or email notification\r\n\u2022 View event details and stay up to date at any time \u2013 you\u2019ll never miss a message\r\n\u2022 Post comments, \u201clike\u201d posts, upload photos, and ask questions before, during, or after the event in the invitation\u2019s private event feed\r\n\u2022 Come back to relive memories of the event invitation at any time",
